  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'With his duel fast approaching, Lindon is locked away in prison.



    As
    a Blackflame, he is too dangerous to remain free. The Skysworn, protectors of
    the Empire, have imprisoned him to keep him under control until the day of his
    promised fight arrives.



    When it does, he will face Jai Long.



    But
    a new danger approaches the Empire, closer every day. A legendary creature of
    impossible size and an endless thirst for blood. A Dreadgod.



    Only the
    Skysworn stand between the people of the land and total annihilation.



    And
    Lindon may be forced to join them.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d7a5e2d89139b2940a46b4a7c3289c9e, type: 2}
